\[(26x + 28y + 30z) \cos \omega = 590,\]or $(13x + 14y + 15z) \cos \omega = 295.$

Also, $[ABP] + [BCP] + [CAP] = [ABC].$  By Heron's formula, $[ABC] = 84,$ so
