Since $a,$ $b,$ $c,$ $d$ are the roots of the quartic in the problem, we can write
\[2z^4 + 8iz^3 + (-9 + 9i)z^2 + (-18 - 2i)z + (3 - 12i) = 2(z - a)(z - b)(z - c)(z - d).\]Setting $z = -i,$ we get
